get.description:
Retrieve the configured source modes for engine="sales".
Query parameters:
namespace_id (str, required): Active namespace UUID.
Response (JSON):
{
"namespace_id": str,
"engine": "sales",
"modes": {
"list_customers": "d365" | "both" | "nce",
...
}
}

post.description:
Body: {"namespace_id": uuid, "probe_namespace_id": uuid}
Sets SET LOCAL nce.namespace_id to *namespace_id* and counts rows in
*probe_namespace_id* — should be 0 when RLS enforces tenant isolation.
